{"3804440": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Kickabout", "steam_appid": 3804440, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3804440/extras/ddc42b191a5ca4c3f41897ad4c5e46ef.avif?t=1783980024\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3804440/extras_big/ddc42b191a5ca4c3f41897ad4c5e46ef.avif?t=1783980024 width=1560 height=480 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Kickabout</strong> is online, first-person arcade football (soccer): you ARE one player on the pitch, and your body picks the touch — foot low, chest mid, head high. It runs on rollback netcode for fair, in-sync play, so every touch, curl and last-ditch tackle comes down to you. Find a match, jump in, play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3804440/extras/f00fca386ca6b5d0e3993d9f6caafb1c.avif?t=1783980024\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3804440/extras_big/f00fca386ca6b5d0e3993d9f6caafb1c.avif?t=1783980024 width=1560 height=260 /></span>Most football games hand you a whole team from a camera in the sky. Kickabout hands you one player — you — in the thick of it, everything through your own eyes, in fast indoor 5-a-side-style matches. Your body reads the ball against your eyeline and picks the contact automatically — no fiddly button combos. You look, you move, you commit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3804440/extras/fa1cfd84990362af4158b4864b0b5ed3.avif?t=1783980024\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3804440/extras_big/fa1cfd84990362af4158b4864b0b5ed3.avif?t=1783980024 width=1560 height=260 /></span>Touch, spin and timing separate a scuffed clearance from a dipping finish under the bar — simple tools, deep mastery.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dribble</strong> — sprint to knock it a clear stride ahead, or keep it close off the sprint.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Charged curve</strong> — hold to charge, strike off-centre for sidespin and bend it into the corner; backspin and topspin shape the flight.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chest &amp; cushion</strong> — pop a dropping ball up for a volley, or hold a dead touch to kill it stone dead.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Headers &amp; volleys</strong> — power a header at head height, or strike straight out of the air.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Slide tackles</strong> — timed right, they actually clear the ball, not nudge it.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3804440/extras/0eed6cd92bd5a487a7bbfe0fee7844a5.avif?t=1783980024\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3804440/extras_big/0eed6cd92bd5a487a7bbfe0fee7844a5.avif?t=1783980024 width=1560 height=260 /></span>Claim the keeper role on the team screen, pull on the gloves, and the game flips.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Parry, catch and dive.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive to reach mid-height out to your side, or slide low when you aim down.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rush off your line to smother a striker through on goal.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3804440/extras/87ae49c0ffce0d8a0ccdd520cd45926a.avif?t=1783980024\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3804440/extras_big/87ae49c0ffce0d8a0ccdd520cd45926a.avif?t=1783980024 width=1560 height=260 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rooms your way</strong> — create, browse and join lobbies, from 1v1 up to 7v7. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Positional voice chat</strong> — push-to-talk with a clear mic indicator; teammates sound like they're where they actually are.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Host tools</strong> — manage players and issue bans.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3804440/extras/9dc0b4985a315105b2a5c958027eb8f8.avif?t=1783980024\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3804440/extras_big/9dc0b4985a315105b2a5c958027eb8f8.avif?t=1783980024 width=1560 height=260 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Four arena sizes</strong> — Small, Medium, Large and XL.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Closed-door indoor</strong> — turf, walls, trusses and rounded goals, no crowd: a tight, focused kickabout space.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your rules</strong> — pick match length (3/5/10/15 min) and goal limit (3/5/10).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Golden Goal</strong> — level at the final whistle? Sudden death settles it.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Kickoff formations</strong> — line up with a dedicated keeper slot.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3804440/extras/25a223cb2c43c99fb741aed52f616f8d.avif?t=1783980024\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3804440/extras_big/25a223cb2c43c99fb741aed52f616f8d.avif?t=1783980024 width=1560 height=260 /></span>Every goal cuts to a TV-style replay — the build-up, the strike in slow motion, broadcast angle cuts (wide, behind-goal, low) tracking the ball into the net, clock paused. Seen enough? Press to vote-skip.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3804440/extras/11235778f4ec340f818ff47dd07ec535.avif?t=1783980024\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3804440/extras_big/11235778f4ec340f818ff47dd07ec535.avif?t=1783980024 width=1560 height=260 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Training</strong> — five ramping drills (Range, Curve, Keeper, Ball Control and Aerials) with on-screen coaching cues.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Free Play</strong> — an offline sandbox: just you and the ball, no rules.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3804440/extras/f014ef2ee669592258e519f64df8cb95.avif?t=1783980024\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3804440/extras_big/f014ef2ee669592258e519f64df8cb95.avif?t=1783980024 width=1560 height=260 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fully rebindable</strong> keyboard-and-mouse controls, grouped into tidy settings tabs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>On-screen control hints</strong> with mouse-button icons that update the moment you rebind.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" 